# Project: Equity Index Spread Library for Macro Expression

## Context
I work on a global macro desk. I want a research library that maps macro shocks to equity
index spreads (and their volatility), so I can answer: "Given this macro move or regime,
which spreads historically respond most reliably, and is it cheaper to express via delta
or via options?"

This repo already contains a library with Bloomberg API access. DO NOT write a new blpapi
wrapper. Reuse the existing one.

